    "body": "triaged: bug, P3, area:mcp, effort:medium - a misleading output field on an agent-surface command, with a workaround (repair the mesh; lay_part_on_face already refuses). The fix follows the recorded refusal-shaped-field law of #956: one honest field, not a new behaviour. Not the safety floor: no posted G-code and no collision check change.\n",
