    "created_at": "2026-11-16T19:13:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-16T19:13:47Z",
    "body": "Thank you again for this report. It is fixed in `main` by PR #2196.\n\nWhen the outside of a face cannot be judged (an open or inside-out shell), `list_features` now gives `null` for `normal` and `facing`, and the field `outside_unknown` gives the reason. Before, it showed a definite direction that could be wrong.\n\nThe fix ships in the next release (v0.23.0). You can test it now with a build from `main`.\n",
